      "id": "DC_kwDOKrJqmc4A7__Z",
      "body": "I use Claude myself and it would interfere with my usage to mess with agents.md. I think we need to update CONTRIBUTING.md for sure. I have a draft for this but I need to still find the right wording. if you have something for this though, go ahead with it.",
